{"time": 1755440425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1492033629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056340271", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没事，我能直接吸收掉鳞片附近的「食物」，这是我身为吞噬者的权能。”"}
